  "paper_id": "fast-2023-io-a-unified-io-stack-for-computational-storage-87e4c185",
  "title": "λ-IO: A Unified IO Stack for Computational Storage",
  "abstract": "The emerging computational storage device offers an opportunity for in-storage computing. It alleviates the overhead of data movement between the host and the device, and thus accelerates data-intensive applications. In this paper, we present λ-IO, a unified IO stack managing both computation and storage resources across the host and the device. We propose a set of designs – interface, runtime, and scheduling – to tackle three critical issues. We implement λ-IO in full-stack software and hardware environment, and evaluate it with synthetic and real applications against Linux IO, showing up to 5.12× performance improvement.",
  "abstract_source_id": "src-abstract-fast-2023-87e4c185",
